function deckEditorPanel(h){ensureCollection(h);const avail=deckAvailable(h),deckCards=[...h.deck].filter(c=>c!=='wound').sort((a,b)=>(NAMES[a]||a).localeCompare(NAMES[b]||b)),collection=[];Object.keys(avail).forEach(card=>{for(let n=0;n<avail[card];n++)collection.push(card)});collection.sort((a,b)=>(NAMES[a]||a).localeCompare(NAMES[b]||b));const empty=Array.from({length:Math.max(0,DECK_CAP-deckCards.length)},(_,index)=>`<span class="deck-build-empty"><b>${deckCards.length+index+1}</b><small>Slot libero</small></span>`).join('');return`<section class="deck-editor"><header class="deck-editor-head"><div><span>MODIFICA MAZZO</span><h2>${NAMES[h.role]}</h2></div><strong class="deck-cap ${deckCards.length===DECK_CAP?'full':''}">${deckCards.length}/${DECK_CAP}</strong></header><div class="deck-workspace"><section class="deck-zone deck-zone-active"><header><div><span>MAZZO IN GIOCO</span><h3>3 × 4 carte</h3></div><small>Clicca una carta per rimuoverla</small></header><div class="deck-card-grid deck-main-grid">${deckCards.map(card=>deckBuildCard(h,card,'deck')).join('')}${empty}</div></section><div class="recovery-side-stack"><section class="deck-zone deck-zone-collection"><header><div><span>CARTE POSSEDUTE</span><h3>Collezione</h3></div><small>Clicca una carta per aggiungerla</small></header><div class="deck-card-grid collection-grid">${collection.map(card=>deckBuildCard(h,card,'collection')).join('')||'<span class="deck-collection-empty">Nessuna carta disponibile</span>'}</div></section><section class="recovery-inventory"><header><div><span>GESTIONE EROE</span><h3>Bag & Equipment</h3></div><small>Usa, equipaggia o scarta</small></header><div class="recovery-inventory-content"></div></section></div></div><footer>Cambi illimitati · massimo ${DECK_COPY_MAX} copie per carta · le Ferite vengono rimosse automaticamente.</footer></section>`}
function startRecoveryTurn(g){g.party.forEach(h=>{h.actions=h.hp>0?RECOVERY_ACTIONS:0;h.shield=0;h.guardBlock=0;h.counter=0;h.bagOpen=true;h.equipOpen=false;stripWounds(h);ensureCollection(h)});g.activeRole=g.party.find(h=>h.hp>0)?.role||g.party[0]?.role||null;g.state='restoring';boardAudit(g,'RECOVERY_TURN_STARTED',{actionsPerHero:'illimitate',roles:g.party.map(h=>h.role)});note(g,'⛺ Turno di Recupero libero: scegli qualsiasi Eroe e gestisci cure, mazzo, Bag ed Equipment. Quando hai finito, premi Fine recupero.');return false}
function selectRecoveryHero(g,role){if(g.state!=='restoring'||!g.party.some(h=>h.role===role))return false;g.activeRole=role;g.combatGridMoveRole=null;return true}
function recoveryHeroSelector(g){return`<nav class="recovery-hero-selector" aria-label="Eroe da gestire">${g.party.map(h=>`<button type="button" class="role-${h.role} ${h.role===g.activeRole?'active':''}" data-recovery-hero="${h.role}" aria-pressed="${h.role===g.activeRole}"><img src="${heroThumbArt(h.role,h)}" alt=""><span><strong>${h.playerName||NAMES[h.role]}</strong><small>${Math.max(0,h.hp)}/${h.maxHp} HP</small></span></button>`).join('')}</nav>`}
